## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design multi-region DR with practical guardrails, data integrity, and cross-account IAM controls under strict RPO/RTO.

## Key Concepts
- Cross-region Kinesis replication
- S3 cross-region replication
- Cross-account IAM roles and trust policies
- Route 53 health checks and failover routing
- Lambda-based orchestration and state rehydration
- Testing, verification, and rollback

